| |*||=|| | /   |  | ---------------------- |  |     .-------.     |
| |.||-|| |/    |  |                        |  |    |         |__  |
| |_||_||_/     |  | writing at 2:00 am..._ |  |    |         |  \\ |
| ------------- |  +------------------------+  |    |_________|__/ |
|  [ library ]  |       [ open journal ]       |     [ coffee ]    |
+---------------+------------------------------+-------------------+`,

`+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  *     .        *        .      .--.    .        *        .   *  |
|     .      *        .          (    )       .        *      .    |
|  *     .        *        .      \`--'    .        *        .   *  |
+---------------+------------------------------+-------------------+
|  _  _  _  / / |  +------------------------+  |        )  (       |
| | || || |/ /  |  | > thoughts.txt         |  |       (  )        |
| |*||=|| | /   |  | ---------------------- |  |     .-------.     |
